---
import profilePic from "../assets/jossprof.webp";import { FacebookLogo, InstagramLogo } from "@phosphor-icons/react";
---
<section class="history section-pad" id="about"><div class="section-shell history-grid"><div class="history-title"><p class="eyebrow">La persona detrás de cada detalle</p><h2 class="display-title">Sobre mí</h2></div><div class="story"><h3>Historia Decorazon Joss</h3><p>En 2015, Jocelyn Segura fundó Decorazon Joss. Empresa líder en decoración de eventos, crean ambientes mágicos y únicos. Destacan por su creatividad, calidad y la confianza ganada en la región.</p><div class="socials"><a href="https://instagram.com" aria-label="Instagram de Decorazon Joss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><InstagramLogo size={21} weight="regular"/></a><a href="https://facebook.com" aria-label="Facebook de Decorazon Joss" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><FacebookLogo size={21} weight="regular"/></a></div></div><figure><img src={profilePic.src} alt="Jocelyn Segura, fundadora de Decorazon Joss" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></section>
<style>
.history{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--menthe) 24%,var(--background))}.history-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(290px,.75fr) minmax(430px,1.4fr) minmax(220px,.65fr);gap:clamp(2rem,3vw,3.5rem);align-items:center}.history-title .display-title{margin:0}.story h3{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.6rem)}.socials{display:flex;gap:.6rem;margin-top:1.75rem}.socials a{width:45px;height:45px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--lagune);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:50%;transition:transform .2s,background .2s,color .2s}.socials a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);color:var(--text-primary);background:var(--surface)}figure{margin:0;position:relative}figure:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:12px -14px -14px 12px;border:2px solid var(--primary);border-radius:48% 48% 30px 30px}figure img{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:48% 48% 30px 30px}
@media(min-width:801px){.history-title .display-title,.story h3{white-space:nowrap}}
@media(max-width:1100px) and (min-width:801px){.history-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.72fr) minmax(360px,1.25fr) minmax(180px,.58fr);gap:2rem}.story h3{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.2rem)}}
@media(max-width:800px){.history-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.history-title{grid-column:1/-1}.story{align-self:start}}
@media(max-width:560px){.history-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;justify-items:center;row-gap:2.75rem;text-align:center}.history-title{grid-column:auto;width:100%;text-align:center}.history-title .eyebrow{margin-bottom:1.1rem;text-align:center}.history-title .display-title{text-align:center}.story{order:3;width:100%;text-align:center}.story h3{margin-bottom:1.2rem}.story p{max-width:38ch;margin:0 auto}.socials{justify-content:center;margin-top:1.6rem}figure{width:min(100%,340px);max-width:340px;margin-inline:auto;justify-self:center}}
</style>
